#~ msgid ""
#~ "typing;trainer;touch typing;keyboard;speed;wpm;words per "
#~ "minute;accuracy;test;"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "picada;entrainament;tòca;picar;clavièr;velocitat;mpm;mots per "
#~ "minuta;precision;ensag;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no doubt that typing on a keyboard is an essential skill in the "
#~ "digital age. Typing fast and accurately gives you more opportunities, "
#~ "more time for what matters to you, and a sense of self-accomplishment."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "I a pas cap de dobte que picar sus un clavièr es una competéncia "
#~ "essenciala dins l'èra numerica. Picar rapidament e amb precision vos dòna "
#~ "mai d'ocasions, mai de temps per çò qu'impòrta per vos, e un sentiment "
#~ "d'auto-realizacion."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch lets you practice typing. Thanks to fast-paced sessions with "
#~ "instant feedback afterwards and a plethora of available languages, you "
#~ "might even have a little fun doing so. With determination, proper "
#~ "technique and some time, you will observe a noticeable increase in both "
#~ "the speed and the accuracy of which your thoughts and ideas are put into "
#~ "words on the screen."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keypunch vos permet de practicar la picada. Mercés a de sessions rapidas "
#~ "amb de retorns instantanèus après e una pletòra de lengas disponiblas, "
#~ "podètz quitament vos divertir un pauc en o far. Amb determinacion, "
#~ "tecnica corrècta e un pauc de temps, observaretz un creis notable de la "
#~ "velocitat e de la precision que vòstras pensadas e idèas son mesas en "
#~ "mots sus l'ecran."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are already a racer at typing, Keypunch still has something for "
#~ "you. Try practicing with numbers and punctuation, or choose your own text "
#~ "to type out as fast as you can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Se sètz ja un correire de picada, Keypunch a encara quicòm per vos. "
#~ "Ensajatz de practicar amb de chifras e de pontuacion, o causissètz vòstre "
#~ "pròpri tèxte per picar lo mai lèu possible."

#~ msgid "Get ready to accelerate your typing!"
#~ msgstr "Preparatz-vos a accelerar vòstra picada !"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch is proudly part of GNOME Circle, an initiative that champions "
